### Catalog — create category
POST http://127.0.0.1:8082/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Books"}

### Catalog — products
GET http://127.0.0.1:8082/products?limit=20&offset=0&sort=id

### Catalog — UPSERT
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8082/products/by-sku/GO-BOOK
Content-Type: application/json

{"category_id":1,"name":"Go","price_cents":1200,"stock":5,"description":null}

### Orders — create draft
POST http://127.0.0.1:8083/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"items":[{"product_id":1,"qty":2}]}

### Orders — confirm
POST http://127.0.0.1:8083/orders/1/confirm
